  "id": "roasted-bell-peppers-with-tomatoes-garlic-and-basil",
  "name": "Roasted Bell Peppers with Tomatoes, Garlic, and Basil",
  "subtitle": "Colorful peppers roasted until tender with a fresh tomato-herb filling",
  "description": "Bell peppers are roasted with cherry tomatoes, sliced garlic, and basil, then finished with herb vinegar for a bright Italian-inspired side.",
